{"attack":"第1回合消失在某处，第2回合攻击对手。可以无视守护进行攻击。","description":"使用潜灵奇袭的宝可梦在第一回合穿入异空间进行蓄力。进行蓄力时的提示为：“[宝可梦的名字]的身影瞬间消失了！”。进行蓄力时不能下达指令。\n在第二回合发动招式。攻击目标造成伤害。\n攻击时无视目标的守住状态以及目标场地的快速防守状态。\n\n攻击后解除上述状态和目标场地的广域防守、戏法防守状态。\n因为属性相克攻击无效时则无法解除。\n不能无视极巨防壁造成的守住状态。\n蓄力的回合会进行行动判定，成功进行蓄力则消耗ＰＰ。\n攻击的回合也会进行行动判定，出现不能行动的情况则招式失败。\n在蓄力的回合，消耗携带的强力香草，可以立刻结束蓄力，在当回合发动招式。\n对使用潜灵奇袭的宝可梦（无论当回合是在进行蓄力或进行攻击）使用突袭可以成功，但是否命中需要另外计算，进行攻击的那回合使用突袭必定未命中。\n该招式不能通过梦话发动。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Shedinja","Level":64},{"Name":"Shuppet","Level":48},{"Name":"Banette","Level":53},{"Name":"Drifblim","Level":0},{"Name":"Mismagius","Level":0},{"Name":"Golett","Level":44},{"Name":"Golurk","Level":46},{"Name":"Phantump","Level":36},{"Name":"Trevenant","Level":36},{"Name":"Gourgeist","Level":48},{"Name":"Yveltal","Level":55},{"Name":"Hoopa form:confined","Level":35},{"Name":"Hoopa form:unbound","Level":35},{"Name":"Decidueye","Level":0},{"Name":"Dhelmise","Level":60},{"Name":"Lunala","Level":63},{"Name":"Lunala form:fullmoon","Level":63},{"Name":"Drakloak","Level":48},{"Name":"Dragapult","Level":48},{"Name":"Basculegion form:male","Level":0},{"Name":"Basculegion form:female","Level":0},{"Name":"Bramblin","Level":35},{"Name":"Brambleghast","Level":35},{"Name":"Greavard","Level":41},{"Name":"Houndstone","Level":46},{"Name":"FlutterMane","Level":70}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":[],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Shuppet","Banette","Darkrai"],"tmMoves9":["Haunter","Gengar","Mew","Misdreavus","Sableye","Shuppet","Banette","Duskull","Dusclops","Drifloon","Drifblim","Mismagius","Spiritomb","Dusknoir","Zorua form:hisuian","Zoroark form:hisuian","Golett","Golurk","Phantump","Trevenant","Hoopa form:confined","Hoopa form:unbound","Decidueye","Mimikyu form:disguised","Drakloak","Dragapult","Spectrier","Basculegion form:male","Basculegion form:female","Ceruledge","Bramblin","Brambleghast","Greavard","Houndstone","Annihilape","FlutterMane","Poltchageist form:counterfeit","Poltchageist form:artisan","Sinistcha form:unremarkable","S